  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Auto-Scrolling Style**\n\nI\'m focused on improving the auto-scrolling sections, aiming for a more \"classic\" aesthetic. The reference site, reidiusinfra.in, offers a good starting point. I\'m leaning toward a smooth, infinitely looping animation with subtle fading, reminiscent of high-end design principles rather than a loud or distracting approach.\n\n\n**Improving Marquee Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on high-speed marquee implementations. Reviewing `reidiusinfra.in` reinforced a commitment to premium aesthetics. My \"BrandsTicker\" will get a subtle grayscale effect that colorizes on hover, better spacing, and a better font. The \"ServicesTicker\" will be adjusted, leaning towards either a high-end slider or a dedicated horizontal scrolling section, similar to that reference site.\n\n\n**Adjusting Service Ticker**\n\nI\'m revisiting the \"ServicesTicker,\" aiming for a premium marquee. The current text marquee isn\'t \"classic\". I\'m implementing a horizontal scroll of cards instead of plain text, and it needs some serious adjustments. I\'ll slow the marquee down, and add edge masking and better typography. Alternatively, I\'m considering a triple-row ticker, with opposing scroll directions, while maintaining high-quality visual treatment. I\'m now testing the `ServicesTicker` to see what can be accomplished.\n\n\n**Rethinking Ticker Implementation**\n\nI\'m moving beyond the text-only approach for the tickers. My current focus is on a more architectural \"Service Showcase\" implemented as an infinite card slider. The `BrandsTicker` will be refined with a white background and faded text-based logos for now. The goal is to bring a higher degree of visual sophistication, taking inspiration from the classic design elements I\'m pursuing. The contrast from the prior attempt felt not classic.\n\n\n**Revisiting Scrolling Implementation**\n\nI\'m now implementing the user\'s feedback by creating a more classic auto-scrolling approach, similar to `reidius infra`. I\'m going to create a more classic \"Service Showcase\" design using cards with icons and text for the \"ServicesTicker\", and update the \"BrandsTicker\" for minimalism. I am still looking at a high-quality single scroll, or a triple-row ticker, which both bring a high degree of visual sophistication, taking inspiration from classic design elements. I need to make sure the other features still look good in the end.\n\n\n**Implementing Brand Marquee**\n\nI\'ve decided on an elegant \"Service Marquee\" with cards. Focusing on the `BrandsTicker` first, I\'ve gone with a white background and subtle zinc-400 text that\'s very slow. I\'ve used an infinite scrolling animation to create an elegant aesthetic, that uses gradient masking. My goal is to maximize minimalism, while maintaining a high quality classic look.\n\n\n**Refining Component Interactions**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how the `ServicesTicker` component interacts. It seems better than before. I\'m prioritizing user experience within the section. Now, I\'m aiming for the best visual presentation, while making the experience intuitive for the user. I plan to refine the card-based scroll, to align with the \"classic\" design.\n\n\n**Optimizing Ticker Animation**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the marquee animation logic for a \"ServicesTicker\" component. I\'m focusing on making the transitions even smoother and more engaging. I\'m now exploring keyframing with `motion.div` to control the animation, emphasizing a seamless loop with subtle fading effects. The current focus is ensuring the components appear without being too distracting.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will refine the auto-scrolling sections to be more \"classic\" and high-end, mirroring the sophisticated aesthetic of premium infrastructure sites. This includes transforming the simple text-marquee into a smooth, architectural service card slider and making the brand ticker more subtle and elegant.\n\n```tsx\nconst BrandsTicker = () => {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"py-16 bg-white border-y border-zinc-100 overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap relative group\">\n      <div className=\"absolute left-0 top-0 w-32 h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-transparent z-20 pointer-events-none\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-32 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-white to-transparent z-20 pointer-events-none\" />\n      <motion.div \n        animate={{ x: [\"0%\", \"-50%\"] }}\n        transition={{ duration: 60, repeat: Infinity, ease: \"linear\" }}\n        className=\"inline-block\"\n      >\n        <div className=\"flex gap-24 items-center px-12\">\n          {[...BRANDS, ...BRANDS].map((brand, i) => (\n            <span key={i} className=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.4em] uppercase hover:text-black transition-colors cursor-default whitespace-nowrap\">\n              {brand}\n            </span>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      </motion.div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n\nconst ServicesTicker = () => {\n  const tickerServices = [\n    { name: \"Structural Design\", icon: Building2 },\n    { name: \"Urban Planning\", icon: Globe },\n    { name: \"Vastu Audit\", icon: Compass },\n    { name: \"Interior Concept\", icon: Home },\n    { name: \"Project Management\", icon: Target },\n    { name: \"BIM Modeling\", icon: DraftingCompass },\n    { name: \"Sustainability\", icon: Zap },\n    { name: \"Site Surveillance\", icon: Video }\n  ];\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"py-24 bg-zinc-950 overflow-hidden relative\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mb-16\">\n        <h2 className=\"text-white/40 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4\">Our Expertise</h2>\n        <h3 className=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">Broad Spectrum <span className=\"italic font-serif text-white/50 text-6xl\">Services.</span></h3>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n        {[0, 1].map((row) => (\n          <motion.div \n            key={row}\n            animate={{ x: row === 0 ? [\"0%\", \"-50%\"] : [\"-50%\", \"0%\"] }}\n            transition={{ duration: 70, repeat: Infinity, ease: \"linear\" }}\n            className=\"flex whitespace-nowrap gap-6\"\n          >\n            {[...tickerServices, ...tickerServices].map((service, i) => (\n              <div key={i} className=\"flex-shrink-0 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-10 py-8 rounded-[32px] flex items-center gap-8 min-w-[340px] hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors cursor-default group\">\n                <div className=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">\n                  <service.icon size={28} />\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <p className=\"text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase\">{service.name}</p>\n                  <p className=\"text-white/20 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mt-1\">Sanchar Excellence</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            ))}\n          </motion.div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"absolute left-0 top-0 w-48 h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-950 to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-48 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-zinc-950 to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\" />\n    </section>\n  );\n};\n```\n\nInstalling dependencies and updating `src/App.tsx`.\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 11
      nanos: 180365522
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
