    modified_response: "I have successfully overhauled the **Sanchar Infratech** website with your requested color scheme and added the Indian Vastu Chakra.\n\n### Key Enhancements:\n\n*   **New Design Aesthetic**:\n    *   **Palette**: Migrated the entire application to a premium **Charcoal and Crisp White** theme.\n    *   **Accent**: Used **Electric Teal** as the primary \"pop\" color for icons, highlights, and active states.\n    *   **Backgrounds**: Replaced playful blues with sophisticated dark zinc and clean white layouts.\n\n*   **Indian Vastu Chakra**:\n    *   Developed a custom, animated **Vastu Chakra** in the consultancy section.\n    *   **Directional Matrix**: Features precise mapping of the 8 directions (N, NE, E, SE, etc.) with their Vedic names (Uttar, Ishaan, Purva, etc.).\n    *   **Elemental Alchemy**: Includes rotating markers for the four elements\342\200\224Water, Fire, Air, and Earth.\n    *   **Brahmasthan Core**: A central \"Energy Pulse\" representing the sacred center of building alignment.\n\n*   **UI & Iconography**:\n    *   Corrected the misplaced navigation icons and updated them to a more modern, consistent set using `lucide-react`.\n    *   Replaced generic icons with contextually relevant architectural symbols (Building2, DraftingCompass, Sparkles).\n    *   Refined the **Project Calculator** and **Transparency Section** with the new color logic.\n\n*   **Consistency Sweep**:\n    *   Updated the **Vastu Guide Popup**, **Team Section**, and **Footer** to ensure no legacy colors remain.\n    *   Polished typography with tighter tracking and serif italics for a high-end architectural feel.\n\nThe application is now fully responsive, following a \"Swiss-Modern\" design philosophy that emphasizes precision and legacy."
