    summary: "The web search found various Unsplash pages containing photos related to the specified queries. Direct photo IDs are not always visible in the search snippets but are typically found on the individual Unsplash photo pages.\n\nHere are the Unsplash resources found for each category:\n\n*   **Bandra Worli Sea Link Mumbai:** Numerous images of the Bandra Worli Sea Link in Mumbai are available on Unsplash. Relevant collections and photos can be found on pages such as \"Bandra Worli Sea Link Mumbai India Pictures\"[1], \"An aerial view of a city and a body of water photo\" which features the Bandra Worli Sea Link[2], and general \"Bandra Worli Sea Link Pictures\"[3] and \"Sea Link Pictures\"[4].\n*   **Gurgaon Cyber City building:** Unsplash offers photos related to Gurgaon Cyber City. An example is \"A very tall building with a sky background photo\"[5], and more general \"Gurgaon Pictures\" are available[6].\n*   **Indian luxury apartment villa:** For Indian luxury apartments or villas, Unsplash provides categories like \"Indian Villa Pictures\"[7], \"India Home Pictures\"[8], \"Indian House Pictures\"[9], and \"India House Pictures\"[10].\n*   **Cricket match stadium in India:** Unsplash has a selection of images featuring cricket stadiums and matches in India. These include \"Cricket stadium with spectators watching a match photo\" showing Arun Jaitley Stadium[11][12], \"Wankhede Stadium, Mumbai, India Pictures\"[13], \"Cricket match is being played in a full stadium\" at Wankhede Stadium[14], and \"A cricket stadium filled with lots of people photo\"[15].\n\nSources:\n[1] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE5L3Z65wSOwycarl147G6coHhB83bMoLiBUbHostnLrRQEmukfAxwlb8qtg74aIZScmq0haXdCRtKuhI0rGfOamaHhegsXzgC85T6ELcBm7AJCTkwDlblmLz-lxoU_uuBDLT8xciCIFhsauh5GtJCNOnoqu5SfQPmqzCc=)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFloCC6Zh50vzrsrYB9A2xkUwwKXGpDVZp2X-TD4lKlorIa